<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?>
<MessageStudioText
	Format="1.2" xmlns="nintendo:msgstudio">
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h04_stop_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まてーい！▼
ここで　あったが　１００ねんめ！
いや　おぬしで　１０００にんめ！▼
これまで　９９９れんしょう　した
わがはいの　あいてを　してもらう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:40:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:40:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>待てーい！▼
ここで　会ったが　１００年め！
いや　おぬしで　１０００人め！▼
これまで　９９９連勝した
我輩の　相手を　してもらう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:44:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:44:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・swanで新規作成
・ストッパーで勝利するまで先に進めてさせてくれない
・GRIDX＝56、GRIDZ＝31、右向きで配置
・会話時
・はい/いいえの選択肢
　はい　→stop_03
　いいえ→stop_04</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:44:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GENTLEMAN
トレーナーID：gentle_05</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T05:56:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h04_stop_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちょっと　まてーい！▼
ここで　あったが　１００ねんめ！
いや　おぬしで　１０００にんめ！▼
これまで　９９９れんしょう　した
わがはいの　あいてを　してもらう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:42:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:41:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ちょっと　待てーい！▼
ここで　会ったが　１００年め！
いや　おぬしで　１０００人め！▼
これまで　９９９連勝した
我輩の　相手を　してもらう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:44:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:44:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・pos起動時
・！マーク表示してから主人公に隣接してメッセージ
・はい/いいえの選択肢
　はい　→stop_03
　いいえ→stop_04</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:45:00" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GENTLEMAN
トレーナーID：gentle_05</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T05:56:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h04_stop_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>がははは！　おぬしの　ような
ひよっこで　１０００れんしょう　とは▽
しょうしょう　ものたりぬ　がな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:45:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:42:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>がははは！　おぬしの　ような
ひよっこで　１０００連勝　とは▽
少々　物足りぬ　がな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:45:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:44:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい選択時
・メッセージ表示後戦闘へ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:38:53" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GENTLEMAN
トレーナーID：gentle_05</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T05:56:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h04_stop_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そうであろう！　９９９れんしょうの
わがはいを　おそれるのも　とうぜん！▼
だが　わがはいと　たたかわねば
さきに　すすませる　わけには　いかん！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:43:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:43:52" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そうであろう！　９９９連勝の
我輩を　恐れるのも　とうぜん！▼
だが　我輩と　戦わねば
先に　進ませる　わけには　いかん！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:46:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:44:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・いいえ選択時
・主人公、一歩戻される
　こいつも合わせて初期位置に戻す？</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:44:14" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GENTLEMAN
トレーナーID：gentle_05</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T05:56:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h04_stop_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>２ねんかん　コツコツと　のばした
れんしょうきろくが……　とだえた……▼
だが　わがはいは　こころざし　たかく
ふたたび　１０００れんしょうを▽
めざすと　せんげん　するのであった！▼
……あっ　おぬしとは　たたかわないよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T05:56:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:39:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>２年間　コツコツと　伸ばした
連勝記録が……　途絶えた……▼
だが　我輩は　志高く
再び　１０００連勝を▽
目指すと　宣言するので　あった！▼
……あっ　おぬしとは　戦わないよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:47:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:44:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・プレイヤー勝利後</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T07:47:40" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GENTLEMAN
トレーナーID：gentle_05</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T05:56:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
